# macOS integration code

Read `docs/architecture/macos-integration.md` first.

- Overlay panels: borderless + non-activating, never key/main, clear background, level and collection
  behavior exactly as documented; changes require an ADR-0003 update.
- Click-through is controlled only by `MousePassthroughController`; default is pass-through.
- Never move/resize/close/focus other apps' windows; never read window titles or screen contents.
- Public APIs only; no private frameworks or SPI.
- Quartz-space values (CGWindowList, AX) are converted to canonical space inside the adapter that reads them.
- Prefer notifications to polling; stop everything when paused, hidden or suspended; remove observers in `stop()`.
- Core Animation renders snapshots only: implicit layer animations disabled, no `CAAnimation` for domain timing, no SpriteKit (ADR-0015).
- Platform behavior must be verified by running the app; record what was verified and what was not.
